  "title50px": "Automate the passage of your students to the canteen",
  "subtitle-hover-block-html": "\n            <p>Eliminate queuing (and pushing and shoving) at the food court with connected solutions modeled on fast food.</p>\n            <p>Give them more break time at lunch by reducing the line at the front of the cafeteria.</p>\n          ",
  "title50px-2": "Modernize your school restaurant from A to Z",
  "subtitle-hover-block-html-2": "\n            <p>Have your students come back with the codes of commercial catering. </p>\n            <p>Seduce ultra-connected students with online school menus, touch-sensitive ordering stations and a touch of artificial intelligence to scan their lunch tray!</p>\n          ",
  "expertise-img-src-2": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59243e1a01e8_enseignement%202.avif",
